# ==========================================
# KELOLA KEGIATAN & PENDAFTARAN EVENT MODULE
# ==========================================

### 1. Lihat Daftar Agenda / Kegiatan OSIS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Tambah Kegiatan Baru (Sesuai Form Kelola Kegiatan UI)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_event": "PPKM",
    "tanggal": "2026-10-15",
    "deskripsi": "Pekan Pelatihan Kreativitas Murid",
    "status": "Mendatang"
}

###

### 3. Lihat Detail Kegiatan Berdasarkan ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Pendaftaran Event (Sesuai Form Modal UI: NISN, Kelas, Catatan)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_siswa": "Manis.",
    "nisn": "234567890",
    "kelas": "xi rpl 2",
    "catatan": "Ingin menambah pengalaman dalam organisasi"
}

###

### 5. Lihat Peserta Terdaftar (Pop-up Modal UI "Peserta: PPKM")
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1/peserta
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Hapus Kegiatan
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1
Accept: application/json
